{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "id": "behind-the-scenes-s01e05-scene-11",
  "pair": "zh-en",
  "title": "明天再见一面  (One Day to Prove Our Show Is Better)",
  "level": "A1 — beginner",
  "labels": {
    "bu_xiaogu": "布小谷",
    "xingzi": "杏子"
  },
  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "When the fan-club president mentions that Xin Huimei herself will appear on rival network ME's flagship talk show, Bu Xiaogu steps outside to call Xingzi and learns Luo Lin is guest-hosting there. Listen to their Mandarin dialogue first.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "辛惠美也会出席？那咱们可以商量商量。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "许先生，我出去一下，马上回来！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "杏子姐，粉红哥他们要上今夜现场，辛惠美也去！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "今夜现场是对方的王牌节目，我记得最近几期骆琳都是客座主持。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "我怕她们两个碰上，又在电视上说淳于总。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "绝对不能让她们再中伤老大，你先稳住许天泽，让我想想办法。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "好消息，我们星天娱乐正式邀请辛惠美和爱美会录制一期我们的谈话节目。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "前提是你们放弃那边的节目。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "收视差那是以前，现在的文娱论被我们制作一部监制，可精彩了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "是魔鬼鱼监制，天下第一的魔鬼鱼！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "好，那明天再见一面，我说服你。",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "辛惠美也会出席？那咱们可以商量商量。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Xin Huimei will attend too? Then we can talk this over.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "许先生，我出去一下，马上回来！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Mr Xu, I will step outside for a moment and be right back!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "杏子姐，粉红哥他们要上今夜现场，辛惠美也去！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Xingzi, Brother Fenhong's group is going on Tonight Live, and Xin Huimei is going too!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "今夜现场是对方的王牌节目，我记得最近几期骆琳都是客座主持。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Tonight Live is their flagship show, and I remember Luo Lin has been guest host lately.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "我怕她们两个碰上，又在电视上说淳于总。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I am afraid the two of them will meet and talk about Chun Yuqiao on television again.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "绝对不能让她们再中伤老大，你先稳住许天泽，让我想想办法。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'We cannot let them slander our boss again; keep Xu Tianze talking first and let me think.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "好消息，我们星天娱乐正式邀请辛惠美和爱美会录制一期我们的谈话节目。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Good news: Xingtian Entertainment formally invites Xin Huimei and her fan club to record our talk show.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "前提是你们放弃那边的节目。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'The condition is that you give up the show over at the rival network.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "收视差那是以前，现在的文娱论被我们制作一部监制，可精彩了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Low ratings were in the past; Entertainment Talk is supervised by Unit One now and is exciting.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "是魔鬼鱼监制，天下第一的魔鬼鱼！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'It is supervised by Manta Ray, the number-one producer in the business!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "好，那明天再见一面，我说服你。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Alright, let us meet again tomorrow, and I will convince you.'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's listen to the whole conversation one last time.",
      "gap": 0.75
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "辛惠美也会出席？那咱们可以商量商量。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "许先生，我出去一下，马上回来！",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "杏子姐，粉红哥他们要上今夜现场，辛惠美也去！",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "今夜现场是对方的王牌节目，我记得最近几期骆琳都是客座主持。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "我怕她们两个碰上，又在电视上说淳于总。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "绝对不能让她们再中伤老大，你先稳住许天泽，让我想想办法。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "好消息，我们星天娱乐正式邀请辛惠美和爱美会录制一期我们的谈话节目。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "前提是你们放弃那边的节目。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "收视差那是以前，现在的文娱论被我们制作一部监制，可精彩了。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "是魔鬼鱼监制，天下第一的魔鬼鱼！",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "好，那明天再见一面，我说服你。",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Invoking Manta Ray's name, Xiaogu wins one day to prove that Xingtian's own talk show is the better stage for Huimei's charity fund. See you next time!",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "明天见！",
      "gap": 0.3
    }
  ],
